<Band Id="rule" Kicker="One rule">
    <h2 class="chrome reveal">First principles.</h2>
    <p class="lede reveal">This startup runs on one rule. Every decision starts from what is certainly true and builds up from there, not from what everyone else does. Measure before you assume. Write down why. Adopt what is proven, and build only what nobody has.</p>
    <p class="lede reveal" data-delay="1">What drives it is older than the rule. A stoic outlook, and Kierkegaard's: do the work for its meaning and purpose, and let the result be what it is. Competition doesn't bother us, and neither does breaking from the norm. This is a startup of one person, and it says so.</p>
    <p class="band-note reveal" data-delay="2">The decision records on this site are that rule at work: each says what was true, what was chosen, and why. <a href="/how-it-works">The rules every turn keeps</a> came out of them.</p>
</Band>

