<Band Id="concepts" Kicker="Four concepts" Short="Concepts">
    <h2 class="chrome reveal">The engine is how, an identity is who, a pack is what.</h2>
    <TileRow>
        <Tile Title="The engine is how">The loop, streaming, the guards, the ledger and handing work to other sessions. It names no product, and every host is a library a few lines of yours start. <a href="/architecture">The whole map</a></Tile>
        <Tile Title="An identity is who" Delay="1">Its voice, its roles and the packs it names, as markdown in a project of its own. Puls, the coding agent and the guide in this page's corner are identities. <a href="/identities">Identities</a></Tile>
        <Tile Title="A pack is what" Delay="2">Tools and their guide, as a package that needs only the contracts. Written once, used by any identity, and served over MCP as it is. <a href="/packs">Every pack</a></Tile>
    </TileRow>
    <p class="band-note">The fourth, a workflow, is how one agent delegates to another and decides on what comes back. It is planned, and the engine's job: <a href="/whats-coming">what's coming</a>.</p>
</Band>

